# Troll
Trolls are tribal woodland creatures that dwell inside groves. They are stout and fat, bearing black hair, beady eyes, large noses, and rock-like skin. Their usual clothing consists of brown or grey rags made of animal skin, and some may wear large conical hats dyed a brighter colour, like red or blue.

No troll likes iron, steel, or sunlight, as they will burn upon touching them. Even though they are dim-witted, some are still capable of Seiðr and complex leadership.
